or your quick response. For how many people totally are t=\r\nhese villas?\r\n\r\nBest regards and thanks for helping,\r\nKathy\r\n\r\n> Am 03.11.2026 um 11:49 schrieb Barefoot Project <barefootproject.kohphayam=\r\n@gmail.com>:\r\n>=20\r\n> =EF=BB=BFHello kathy\r\n>=20\r\n> Hope you are well\r\n>=20\r\n> We only have2 rooms available during=20\r\n>=20\r\n> 15 feb - 19 feb=20\r\n> 2 villa\r\n>=20\r\n> 13 feb - 17 feb\r\n> 1 villa=20\r\n> 1 superior queen=20\r\n>=20\r\n> Noted: the villa is bungalow with ac\r\n>=20\r\n> Have a lovely day\r\n>=20\r\n> barefoot project\r\n> =F0=9F=90=B6=F0=9F=91=A9=F0=9F=8F=BD=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=A6=B3=F0=9F=A7=94=F0=9F=\r\n=8F=BB=E2=80=8D=E2=99=82=EF=B8=8F=F0=9F=90=A5=F0=9F=AA=A9=F0=9F=92=96=F0=9F=8C=\r\n=B8=F0=9F=8E=80\r\n>=20\r\n>> On 3 Nov 2026, at 05:29, Kathy Gautschi <kathrin.gautschi@gmail.com> wrot=\r\ne:\r\n>>=20\r\n>> Dear Barefootproject Team,\r\n>>=20\r\n>> I was wondering if you have any rooms available between 13 and 25 Februar=\r\ny 2027for a stay of 3 or 4 nights.\r\n>>=20\r\n>> We are a group of 8 adults and are flexible regarding room arrangements, w=\r\nhether double rooms or rooms for four people.\r\n>>=20\r\n>> Would you kindly check your availability for us?\r\n>>=20\r\n>> We would absolutely love the opportunity to stay at your beautiful place a=\r\nnd enjoy some time in such a wonderful setting.\r\n>>=20\r\n>> I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n>>=20\r\n>>=20\r\n>>=20\r\n>> Many thanks in advance and kind regards,\r\n>>=20\r\n>> Kathrin\r\n>>=20\r\n>>=20\r\n>=20\r\n\r\n--Apple-Mail-AF3FD29C-B294-4FD0-9942-4B340C5D5F95\r\nContent-Type: text/html;\r\n\tcharset=utf-8\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\n<html class=3D"apple-mail-supports-explicit-dark-mode"><head><meta http-equi=\r\nv=3D"content-type" content=3D"text/html; charset=3Dutf-8"></head><body dir=3D=\r\n"auto">Hello,<div><br></div><div>Thank you so much for your quick response. =\r\nFor how many people totally are these villas?</div><div>