\r\n\r\nLighthouse handles pricing, distribution and reservations in the background=\r\n so you can focus on your guests. Hotels using Lighthouse (https://email.my=\r\nlighthouse.com/e3t/Ctc/ZR+113/ctkQp04/VVBCnt19qf5NW62z2tX5PjQWSW5q0Twr5WY_l=\r\nXN35KTBx5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3nWW8gzYxt8NTSfxW2hQfRx6DwVgkN6rJZLwTVs74Mv5Vm043pG-=\r\nVDXb341CG8TLW1J9zgZ9bc5CbW1ggdGy5nY9dGW5m-w0f1PtJkpN1w1hX0rjMmwW8rXCwM7Jjky=\r\nLW57H-Gv5JvX4BW75tbgr7l8pxNN6kNR7cy4BMVW4xHHyf1DzNP7W4b9bR28q0mn6W4bNvDY6dg=\r\nDPZW6JTStN101RjdW7cCy_26KW7zNW68g5bQ1nfM_7N623KMj5rFQ5W2b6vx96JsqH3N4w88nbK=\r\nKHVMW1P338F1ZxP97W5FGJQH3P-W9TN7lHkvb3-bNfN3sT5pLSy5DbW6T0hZX531hclVgPK897k=\r\nbCcBV9BpVW7kJ5dfW95BdvB6k4G5MW2Fg5RK52xc56N33_CBPzQxqZW8bYF_X5gmwSZW1L2q9m4=\r\nMtsfgf4KnCC004 ) earn 21% more revenue on average.\r\n\r\n=F0=9F=92=A1 How to spot high-demand dates early\r\n\r\n=F0=9F=93=88 Watch three signals, not just one\r\n\r\nHigh-demand dates rarely announce themselves. Look for:\r\n\r\n- Booking pace: Are you picking up faster than at this point last year? If =\r\na date had two reservations then and has six now, something is driving dema=\r\nnd.\r\n- Local events: Concerts, festivals, trade fairs and school breaks. Check y=\r\nour event calendar every week.\r\n- Competitor behavior: Rising rates or sell-outs nearby are a prompt to loo=\r\nk closer at your own dates.\r\n\r\n=F0=9F=97=93=EF=B8=8F Make it a weekly habit (under an hour)\r\n\r\n- Monday (15 to 20 min): Scan the next 30 to 60 days of reservations. Compa=\r\nre pickup to last year and check events for the same dates.\r\n- Mid-week (5 to 10 min): Check competitor rates on the OTAs for the dates =\r\nyou flagged.\r\n- End of week (10 min): Decide on a rate move before the weekend. Even a sm=\r\nall step up beats waiting.\r\n\r\n=F0=9F=AA=9C Raise rates in steps\r\n\r\nTest the market with a small increase first. A sudden spike can push early =\r\nbookers to competitors. When your best nights start filling up, a two-night=\r\n minimum on Friday and Saturday can help you avoid losing Sunday. Keep your=\r\n bigger rate moves for dates where bookings are strong, there=E2=80=99s a c=\r\nlear local reason for demand, and competitors are filling up too.\r\n\r\n=F0=9F=8E=AF Use competitor rates as a prompt, not a rule\r\n\r\nA competitor selling out at =E2=82=AC150 shows demand is there. It doesn=E2=\r\n=80=99t set your price, because their occupancy, costs and room mix differ =\r\nfrom yours. If your pickup is strong, your ceiling may be higher. After eac=\r\nh busy period, compare actual occupancy, ADR and RevPAR with what you expec=\r\nted.\r\n\r\nLuxury hotel reception with marble walls, a glowing gold front desk, elegan=\r\nt floral arrangements, and attentive staff. (https://email.mylighthouse.com=\r\n/e3t/Ctc/ZR+113/ctkQp04/VVBCnt19qf5NW62z2tX5PjQWSW5q0Twr5WY_lXN35KTBx5m_5PW=\r\n5BWr2F6lZ3ncN6tBR3TdJc9qW4ZLRgz7LybLjVbWv6777JFzdW596dnn3RbpwPW7bJJ4837VBTp=\r\nW2M5wG_7KghF6W37t0X13_9w1KMPxNPH5HlDtV9gPsY4N_6cvW1Xz9G22LxLN0W3skyvr5vKbmW=\r\nW74rbN33yb7q7W8fJqsz5zC3BKW48Frp43M53HMV8cGBK8gBhHZN5s_8wvLCNQ4W7JW9m376k3s=\r\n4W2nK59b1dpJQ9N6cDRlTvLnK-W1y4jrl7RVbnJW4ZQD1r6FcGKdW2SJ7yQ5tzrCJW8dgtXq4h5=\r\nvb8W53TtX31hk4nZW1DF9HW27rGDSVWgj-s6dGp6ZVQ56JN8Z1hpsN1FfB9RkBcrHW6TL14t4wf=\r\nV69VlLLR-6G7_bzW4j7FPW5-GgR3W24CSZn7ykB05W78PL-z2M2tPwTf2r48XHdGSf4TcM9l04 =\r\n)\r\n\r\nContact us (https://email.mylighthouse.com/e3t/Ctc/ZR+113/ctkQp04/VVBCnt19q=\r\nf5NW62z2tX5PjQWSW5q0Twr5WY_lXN35KTDj3prCCW95jsWP6lZ3ngW7Ydf-78NS_gzVFq0s053=\r\nJvjhW4L4y_c5Hf4T6W7wdhw_4mrp1ZVZD8Zq2NGGQpW1-bF015QtXpNW773xzL3_SsF5VM_Yxr4=\r\nm8gDwW2TZ3cP9cKvgnN7bSy5t7DKvkN26nv-ggXGjVW2pMZ7z4p2m_xW1dD75d6D-1l4W4z_Yr5=\r\n34scs2W2r14m32Wj1K-W13csCl1-HVTsW5XxkQj2HL3KGW3-566g8qQ6t4W8NPzPZ6-cqb9N2cS=\r\n0NpycfRdW2bNTs26-4HfsW3Q7BV67BFyMjW3k5mfJ3Z_KC2W3KK5-V3NRzpdW757Zgn3Cd1vwW1=\r\nLyWRk8ckcFcW6tYSFX8JXVv9W2wtWgq19JB0sW601ZGz38TK16N8WQFKG466t7f1flYvx04 )\r\n\r\nResources (https://email.mylighthouse.com/e3t/Ctc/ZR+113/ctkQp04/VVBCnt19qf=\r\n5NW62z2tX5PjQWSW5q0Twr5