l.com>\r\n <F0345A74-FC50-4D78-BE44-B2F3A242ECA3@gmail.com>\r\nIn-Reply-To: <F0345A74-FC50-4D78-BE44-B2F3A242ECA3@gmail.com>\r\nFrom: Patricia N <neubauerpa@gmail.com>\r\nDate: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 18:56:02 +0800\r\nX-Gm-Features: AclHuK_SBvACgWqpSkXUHTCHqpsRB3b1Pvgd0JwM3pEBB0hUuC19ppWqUz5Ky6U\r\nMessage-ID: <CAAG3Z1miHhUwLwq2Ms9p1Di1Cp+QxdFnDU==a-3Hm8VH85j7yg@mail.gmail.com>\r\nSubject: Re: Koh Surin boat trip help\r\nTo: Barefoot Project <barefootproject.kohphayam@gmail.com>\r\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="0000000000004aa042065f713a23"\r\n\r\n--0000000000004aa042065f713a23\r\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\nHello,\r\nI looked further into the trip to Surin. I think it is easiest if we just\r\njoin a one day snorkeling trip to Surin Island. How much would that cost\r\nfor two adults and two children? Do you know how long a boat takes to get\r\nto Surin? We are thinking of going either on the 20th, 21st or 22nd. We are\r\nflexible.\r\n\r\nThank you for your help.\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nPatricia\r\n\r\nOn Wed, Nov 4, 2026, 08:31 Barefoot Project <\r\nbarefootproject.kohphayam@gmail.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Hello partricia\r\n>\r\n> Hope you are well\r\n>\r\n> Yes there is boat that will go to Turin island there is one way to the\r\n> Turin island also\r\n>\r\n> If may I asked when are you planning to go and I will ask their schedule\r\n> for you\r\n>\r\n> Have a lovely day\r\n>\r\n> barefoot project\r\n> =F0=9F=90=B6=F0=9F=91=A9=F0=9F=8F=BD=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=A6=B3=F0=9F=A7=94=F0=\r\n=9F=8F=BB=E2=80=8D=E2=99=82=EF=B8=8F=F0=9F=90=A5=F0=9F=AA=A9=F0=9F=92=96=F0=\r\n=9F=8C=B8=F0=9F=8E=80\r\n>\r\n> On 3 Nov 2026, at 21:30, Patricia N <neubauerpa@gmail.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hello,\r\n>\r\n> My family and I are really looking forward to our stay in your resort. I\r\n> was wondering if you could help me something. We were thinking of going t=\r\no\r\n> Koh Surin for one or two nights after our stay with you. I was hoping the=\r\nre\r\n> is a tour operator that departs from Koh Phayam. Maybe even one way would\r\n> be fine and then we would return to a different port. Or both ways from K=\r\noh\r\n> Phayam. Do you know a boat trip operator with whom we could book this?\r\n>\r\n> Thank you very much for your help.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n> Patricia\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n\r\n--0000000000004aa042065f713a23\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset="UTF-8"\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\n<div dir=3D"auto">Hello,=C2=A0<div dir=3D"auto">I looked further into the t=\r\nrip to Surin. I think it is easiest if we just join a one day snorkeling tr=\r\nip to Surin Island. How much would that cost for two adults and two childre=\r\nn?=C2=A0Do you know how long a boat takes to get to Surin? We are thinking =\r\nof going either on the 20th, 21st or 22nd. We are flexible.=C2=A0</div><div=\r\n dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Thank you for your help.=C2=A0</d=\r\niv><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Best,=C2=A0</div><div dir=\r\n=3D"auto">Patricia=C2=A0</div></div><br><div class=3D"gmail_quote gmail_quo=\r\nte_container"><div dir=3D"ltr" class=3D"gmail_attr">On Wed, Nov 4, 2026, 08=\r\n:31 Barefoot Project &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:barefootproject.kohphayam@gmail.=\r\ncom">barefootproject.kohphayam@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquot=\r\ne class=3D"gmail_quote" style=3D"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc sol=\r\nid;padding-left:1ex"><div style=3D"line-break:after-white-space">Hello part=\r\nricia<div><br></div><div>Hope you are well</div><div><br></div><div>Yes the=\r\nre is boat that will go to Turin island there is one way to the Turin islan=\r\nd also</div><div><br></div><div>If may I asked when are you planning to go =\r\nand I will ask their schedule for you</div><div><br></div><div>Have a lovel=\r\ny day</div><div><br id=3D"m_2733504809190830866lineBreakAtBeginningOfMessag=\r\ne"><div>\r\n<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spac