com>\r\n <F0345A74-FC50-4D78-BE44-B2F3A242ECA3@gmail.com> <CAAG3Z1miHhUwLwq2Ms9p1Di1Cp+QxdFnDU==a-3Hm8VH85j7yg@mail.gmail.com>\r\n <24BD4D29-DECB-40DE-BBD6-A85DD0001469@gmail.com>\r\nIn-Reply-To: <24BD4D29-DECB-40DE-BBD6-A85DD0001469@gmail.com>\r\nFrom: Patricia N <neubauerpa@gmail.com>\r\nDate: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:09:02 +0800\r\nX-Gm-Features: AclHuK--1zSyzQqRHqzX5NNqMpp1QNRhP5t0aVkREQjqvlZa3dd7E_PlUZIY3zk\r\nMessage-ID: <CAAG3Z1mF9SeHPe-n+4sBjEu5eOue0DkiyNgj58iJdOyHp-2ZtA@mail.gmail.com>\r\nSubject: Re: Koh Surin boat trip help\r\nTo: Barefoot Project <barefootproject.kohphayam@gmail.com>\r\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="000000000000e2543a065f7315db"\r\n\r\n--000000000000e2543a065f7315db\r\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\nHi,\r\n\r\nMy apologies. I meant 20th, 21st or 22nd of December.\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\n\r\nOn Wed, Nov 4, 2026, 20:16 Barefoot Project <\r\nbarefootproject.kohphayam@gmail.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Hello particia\r\n>\r\n> Hope you are well\r\n>\r\n> Its would cost around 2800 thb that=E2=80=99s last season price per perso=\r\nn\r\n>\r\n> I think 1.5 of hours\r\n>\r\n> May I ask what month please\r\n>\r\n> Their schedule is not out yet\r\n>\r\n> Have a lovely day\r\n> barefoot project\r\n> =F0=9F=90=B6=F0=9F=91=A9=F0=9F=8F=BD=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=A6=B3=F0=9F=A7=94=F0=\r\n=9F=8F=BB=E2=80=8D=E2=99=82=EF=B8=8F=F0=9F=90=A5=F0=9F=AA=A9=F0=9F=92=96=F0=\r\n=9F=8C=B8=F0=9F=8E=80\r\n>\r\n> On 4 Nov 2026, at 17:56, Patricia N <neubauerpa@gmail.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hello,\r\n> I looked further into the trip to Surin. I think it is easiest if we just\r\n> join a one day snorkeling trip to Surin Island. How much would that cost\r\n> for two adults and two children? Do you know how long a boat takes to get\r\n> to Surin? We are thinking of going either on the 20th, 21st or 22nd. We a=\r\nre\r\n> flexible.\r\n>\r\n> Thank you for your help.\r\n>\r\n> Best,\r\n> Patricia\r\n>\r\n> On Wed, Nov 4, 2026, 08:31 Barefoot Project <\r\n> barefootproject.kohphayam@gmail.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Hello partricia\r\n>>\r\n>> Hope you are well\r\n>>\r\n>> Yes there is boat that will go to Turin island there is one way to the\r\n>> Turin island also\r\n>>\r\n>> If may I asked when are you planning to go and I will ask their schedule\r\n>> for you\r\n>>\r\n>> Have a lovely day\r\n>>\r\n>> barefoot project\r\n>> =F0=9F=90=B6=F0=9F=91=A9=F0=9F=8F=BD=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=A6=B3=F0=9F=A7=94=F0=\r\n=9F=8F=BB=E2=80=8D=E2=99=82=EF=B8=8F=F0=9F=90=A5=F0=9F=AA=A9=F0=9F=92=96=F0=\r\n=9F=8C=B8=F0=9F=8E=80\r\n>>\r\n>> On 3 Nov 2026, at 21:30, Patricia N <neubauerpa@gmail.com> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>> Hello,\r\n>>\r\n>> My family and I are really looking forward to our stay in your resort. I\r\n>> was wondering if you could help me something. We were thinking of going =\r\nto\r\n>> Koh Surin for one or two nights after our stay with you. I was hoping th=\r\nere\r\n>> is a tour operator that departs from Koh Phayam. Maybe even one way woul=\r\nd\r\n>> be fine and then we would return to a different port. Or both ways from =\r\nKoh\r\n>> Phayam. Do you know a boat trip operator with whom we could book this?\r\n>>\r\n>> Thank you very much for your help.\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards,\r\n>> Patricia\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n\r\n--000000000000e2543a065f7315db\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset="UTF-8"\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\n<div dir=3D"auto">Hi,<div dir=3D"auto"><br><div dir=3D"auto">My apologies. =\r\nI meant 20th, 21st or 22nd of December.=C2=A0</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br></=\r\ndiv><div dir=3D"auto">Thank you.=C2=A0</div></div></div><br><div class=3D"g=\r\nmail_quote gmail_quote_container"><div dir=3D"ltr" class=3D"gmail_attr">On =\r\nWed, Nov 4, 2026, 20:16 Barefoot Project &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:barefootproj=\r\nect.kohphayam@gmail.com">barefootproject.kohphayam@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:=\r\n<br></div><blockquote class=3D"gmail_quote" style=3D"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;bord=\r\n