handles pricing, distribution and reservations in the background=\r\n so you can focus on your guests. Hotels using Lighthouse (https://email.my=\r\nlighthouse.com/e3t/Ctc/ZR+113/ctkQp04/VWS9bx1T2xx3W8b-qjG20MzhMVmLt1V5Xc_l4=\r\nN1YBntC5m_5PW5BWr2F6lZ3nlW4m8KDS4HjH57W88npFn7Gt_91W5GSM084F99HKW5l6m6z8Jp2=\r\n-_N4751xzyyCQ9N1rNt-Vn9QDHMGM-zsCp3xfW8RCQ_Z2ClMwGW7vxlZb61Zm5bMKPxTwv9xYqW=\r\n8xSsGh6W6J4hW2bRTT64RpkS4W5JHGgr6-s6HnW1rMm5F1SnLTJW7f-lLr5r1GkKW6Xxx0M8h_F=\r\nXVW8DS6635GbP1yW4ZydCd2JqhnCVkHKcX8fngxfVXQj3Z7nTl84W27HYF63FhGTsVZSwwD3tk0=\r\n69W58SjcV2tSCF1W4j4lT14VnZZJW4HDkXv8ltvTtVL_HSx96t3JSW8gM8pG6MTTghW4ff7qz3J=\r\nvhxtN6cHDLLpRGVwVHTHgP5lxGSYW788dkG1V18HjW6jpx2D7ln0WmW2QkZ9_7l0Z2FW18P3gZ8=\r\nhzPbrf7wRcWH04 ) earn 21% more revenue on average.\r\n\r\n=F0=9F=92=A1 GEO basics for your hotel\r\n\r\n=F0=9F=A7=AD GEO helps AI recommend you, SEO helps travelers find you\r\n\r\nSEO ranks your website in a list of results. GEO gets your hotel named in a=\r\nn AI-written answer. The groundwork overlaps, so improving one helps the ot=\r\nher.\r\n\r\nAI-sourced traffic to travel sites grew 194% in 2026, and 37% of travelers =\r\nalready use AI assistants built into travel sites.\r\n\r\n=E2=9C=8D=EF=B8=8F Write facts AI can quote\r\n\r\n=E2=80=9CCharming boutique hotel=E2=80=9D gives AI nothing to use. =E2=80=\r\n=9C14-room guesthouse in Bruges, five minutes from the old market square, f=\r\nree parking, dogs welcome=E2=80=9D does.\r\n\r\n- Name your hotel and town in key sentences\r\n- Add room count, distances and pet policy\r\n- Make each key sentence make sense on its own\r\n\r\n=F0=9F=94=81 Make your details match everywhere\r\n\r\nAI also draws on OTA listings, review sites and Google, not just your websi=\r\nte. If check-in is 3 pm on one and 4 pm on another, AI may repeat the wrong=\r\n one or skip your hotel.\r\n\r\n- Write a one-page fact sheet: address, rooms, check-in and out, parking, p=\r\nets, distances\r\n- Make sure your booking engine and channel manager